WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.547
First-hand data is collected directly. Second-hand data comes from published or

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:07.005
previously collected sources.

00:00:07.867 --> 00:00:12.856
Is interviewing farmers directly collecting first-hand or second-hand data? The

00:00:12.856 --> 00:00:16.848
answer is first-hand. Collected directly means first-hand data.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:23.001
A researcher on a football field collects data by studying published census data. Is

00:00:23.001 --> 00:00:26.788
this first-hand or second-hand data? Pause the video and think.

00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:33.243
A researcher on a football field collects data by studying published census data. Is

00:00:33.243 --> 00:00:38.066
this first-hand or second-hand data? The answer is second-hand. Obtained from a

00:00:38.066 --> 00:00:40.075
published source means second-hand data.
